LAB :
======
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: website-deployment
  labels:
    app: website
spec:
  replicas: 1
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: website
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: website
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: website
        image: harshadocker13/mywebsite:4
        ports:
        - containerPort: 80
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: website-service
spec:
  selector:
    app: website
  ports:
  - protocol: TCP
    port: 80
    targetPort: 80
  type: NodePort

kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml

Run port forwarding on EC2
===========================

$ kubectl port-forward service/website-service 8080:80 --address 0.0.0.0

sudo lsof -i :8080

AWS: open the port 8080 in AWS security

Access the Application (Browser:):  

http://EC2-IP:8080
